# An application takes the newest interpreter its dependencies allow,
# not being there to be imported (section 1 of the organization
# standard): this tree has no matrix and runs on one interpreter, so
# .python-version and requires-python name the same release. 3.15 is
# the newest with a release candidate out, which counts here, and
# btclib and bitcoin-core-rpc, this tree's only two dependencies, both
# install on it.
#
# A whole-line comment only: a trailing comment on the version line
# makes uv ignore the file and fall back to a default interpreter.
3.15
